r","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids runs 1951 to 2025. On the middle, January to February and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025, February to March came in at 39% of normal on the middle, while June to July hit 120%. Grid 21733 had its driest year in 1956 at 50% of normal.</p>"}
